    {"id":"L10-P02","type":"calculation","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction-calculation","question":"CO₂中碳元素和氧元素的质量比是？","options":["1:1","1:2","3:8","12:16"],"answer":2,"explanation":"CO₂中C:O质量比=12:(16×2)=12:32=3:8。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction-calculation"]},
    {"id":"L10-P03","type":"calculation","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction-calculation","question":"CaCO₃中钙元素的质量分数是？","options":["20%","30%","40%","50%"],"answer":2,"explanation":"CaCO₃相对分子质量=40+12+16×3=100，钙元素质量分数=40/100×100%=40%。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction-calculation"]},
    {"id":"L10-P04","type":"concept","difficulty":"basic","knowledgePoint":"law-of-mass-conservation","question":"化学反应前后，一定不变的是？","options":["分子种类","原子种类","物质种类","分子数目"],"answer":1,"explanation":"质量守恒的微观本质：化学反应前后原子的种类、数目、质量都不变。","knowledgeIds":["law-of-mass-conservation"]},
    {"id":"L10-P05","type":"concept","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"law-of-mass-conservation","question":"下列现象能用质量守恒定律解释的是？","options":["水结冰后质量不变","铁生锈后质量增加","酒精挥发后质量减少","玻璃破碎后质量不变"],"answer":1,"explanation":"铁生锈是化学变化，能用质量守恒定律解释。其他都是物理变化。","knowledgeIds":["law-of-mass-conservation"]},
    {"id":"L10-P06","type":"calculation","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction-calculation","question":"H₂SO₄的相对分子质量是？","options":["96","98","100","110"],"answer":1,"explanation":"H₂SO₄的相对分子质量=1×2+32+16×4=98。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction-calculation"]},
    {"id":"L10-P07","type":"calculation","difficulty":"medium","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction-calculation","question":"50g CaCO₃中钙元素的质量约为？","options":["10g","20g","40g","50g"],"answer":1,"explanation":"CaCO₃中钙元素质量分数=40/100=40%，50g中含钙20g。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction-calculation"]},
    {"id":"L10-P08","type":"calculation","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"mass-fraction-calculation","question":"NH₄NO₃中氮、氢、氧元素的质量比是？","options":["2:4:3","14:2:24","7:1:12","7:1:8"],"answer":2,"explanation":"N:H:O质量比=(14×2):(1×4):(16×3)=28:4:48=7:1:12。","knowledgeIds":["mass-fraction-calculation"]},
    {"id":"L10-P09","type":"concept","difficulty":"hard","knowledgePoint":"law-of-mass-conservation","question":"下列关于质量守恒定律的说法正确的是？","options":["10g水变成10g水蒸气符合质量守恒定律","镁条燃烧后固体质量增加，不符合质量守恒定律","化学反应前后原子种类和数目不变","质量守恒定律适用于所有变化"],"answer":2,"explanation":"A是物理变化；B中增加的质量来自氧气，总质量守恒；D只适用于化学变化。","knowledgeIds":["law-of-mass-conservation"]},
